    "text": "Let <math><mi>O</mi></math> be the origin and let <math><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi><mi>R</mi></math> be an arbitrary triangle. The point<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi></math> is such that <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> then triangle <math><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi><mi>R</mi></math> has <math><mi>S</mi></math> as its",
